:''This enemy has no official name.''
'''MikuDoge''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 9.4 Update|Version 9.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = MikuDoge
|image = E 503.png
|appearance = [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 45¢ - 177¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy is a faster and stronger variant of [[Doge]] with a small chance to [[Dodge Attack|dodge attacks]] from Cat Units.

==Strategy==
Spamming meatshields against this enemy may be inadvisable as they could activate its dodge ability without dealing much damage themselves. Otherwise, treat it just as you would a regular Doge.

